if(key==='help'){w.body.innerHTML='<div class="classic-dialog"><h2>Welcome to NavOS</h2><p>Double-click a desktop icon to open it. On a phone, tap once.</p><p>Drag a blue title bar to move a window. Use the title-bar buttons to minimize, maximize or close it. Click a taskbar button to restore a window.</p><p>My Work contains all four projects. About Nav, Skills & Tools and Contact contain the original portfolio content.</p><p>Keyboard: Enter opens a selected icon; Escape closes the Start menu; Alt + F4 closes the active window. Right-click the desktop for display settings. Ctrl + Escape opens Start; Alt + Tab switches windows. Shortcuts can be dragged or deleted to the Recycle Bin.</p><p>This is a browser-based portfolio inspired by Windows XP. The welcome profiles select an experience; they do not require an account.</p><button class="classic-button">OK</button></div>';w.body.querySelector('button').onclick=()=>close(w);return}
